 e around 130-150 bpm but there is no minimum HR\; do not speed up to raise
  HR or force Apple Watch Zone 2.\n\nAll session distance includes easy war
 m-up\, recoveries and cooldown. Warm up easy plus relaxed strides before q
 uality. Pace guides only: threshold initially 4:08-4:15/km\; controlled 10
 K repetitions initially 3:58-4:05/km\; strong aerobic/steady 4:30-4:50/km\
 ; HM/long speed endurance initially 4:18-4:24/km. Use effort\, HR behaviou
 r\, terrain\, wind and progression\; finish controlled and do not race the
  final repetition. Progress duration or repetition length before pace. Do
  not compensate later for a session that was too hard.
