SUMMARY:Easy plus strides
DESCRIPTION:Week 12 (10K BENCHMARK / CONSOLIDATION). Planned distance: 14 k
 m. Weekly planned distance: 44 km.\n\n14 km easy + 4–6 relaxed strides.\
 n\nEasy running: conversational and relaxed\, with no pace target. HR may
  often be around 130-150 bpm but there is no minimum HR\; do not speed up
  to raise HR or force Apple Watch Zone 2.\nStrides: 4-6 x 20 s unless spec
 ified otherwise\, fast but relaxed with full recovery and good mechanics\;
  never all-out sprinting. Keep them low fatigue.\n\nBuild weeks maintain t
 he aerobic base while improving speed endurance at approximately 56-61 km\
 , with one major Thursday quality session plus strides and selected long-r
 un finishes. Health\, enjoyment and sustainable progression take priority
  over mileage. If fatigue accumulates\, shorten Tuesday first\, then Sunda
 y\; localised pain\, altered gait or worsening soreness calls for reduced
  load. Optional manually added Saturday: 6-10 km very easy\; redistribute
  mileage by shortening Sunday first\, then Tuesday\, preserving Thursday q
 uality\; do not automatically add volume or exceed approximately 60-62 km.
